    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2019-june/q10",
      "question": "<p>A circle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2 + y^2 - 4x + 8y - 8 = 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Find</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(i) the coordinates of the centre of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>,</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(ii) the exact radius of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>The straight line with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x = k\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a constant, is a tangent to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>.</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Find the possible values for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
